    "sentence_translations": [
      "Live inside a painting for 10 dollars",
      "",
      "Have you ever wondered what it would feel like to live inside a painting?",
      "",
      "As of recently, there is an American artist who can let you experience this.",
      "This artist wanted to rent out his empty room.",
      "He arranged his room based on Van Gogh's “Bedroom in Arles”, and arranged it so that it became just like in the picture.",
      "The bed, table, and even the color of the walls are all just like in the picture.",
      "",
      "This room costs only 10 dollars per night.",
      "The artist says: “The most important thing is to let everyone experience what it is like to live inside a picture.”"
    ]
